- If the passport expiration is within 6 months of your planned return, renew the passport before applying for the visa or traveling. Many countries/visa offices will reject applications or deny entry otherwise.  
- If time is tight, look into expedited passport renewal options with your government.  
- If you tell me the destination country and your planned travel dates, I can look up that country’s official entry/visa passport‑validity requirement for you.

